      "index": "b1U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 279967391,
      "version": 340,
      "versionNonce": 1169485951,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783757506711,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "内容核心：自己动手实践的AI项目、从别的渠道获取的Good idea！\n            通过这些项目，激发用户的动手心理，它能做一个这样的东西\n            我为什么不行呢？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
